{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_title", "source_sha256": "ea1fe9b8e8b2ffacba93f2c1ec5239186e38bdcc7de762215052f115923e19a7", "ja": "そして少女達は立ち上がった", "zh": "于是，少女们奋发向上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fd9d50241084246ce50bf6d7f2dfb6b16220cd089a743e4c1528ce275e5eebcb", "ja": "センターとはすなわち主人公！\nはりきる百合子だったが、日夜繰り広げられ\nる仲間たちとの特訓は前途多難！　メンバー\nに支えられつつ困難に耐え抜いた百合子は、\n仲間たちと共にステージを成功させる！", "zh": "Center也就是所谓的主角！\n百合子卯足全力练习，\n但她和同伴日以继夜进行的特训却前途多舛！\n在团员的支持下，跨越重重困难的百合子，\n和同伴一起成功完成表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3dc7f7e341b6bbe6f0c8a8e13d958a250c3e9ec7e61de65a994e2e4f406c6ab3", "ja": "（次の公演に向けてのレッスンが始まった。百合子は\n……紗代子と杏奈と、何か相談してるみたいだな）", "zh": "（下次公演的训练课程开始了。\n百合子……好像在和纱代子、杏奈讨论些什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "53820c1a60b077443e3d00aee0ed3dfda005ec03e9bd96b85580c70510528982", "ja": "センターをやるなら、自分でも苦手だと思っている\nところは、ちゃんと克服した方がいいと思うんだ！", "zh": "如果要当Center，\n最好要克服自己不擅长的地方喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d135766a286ea2a18115c6f8752bb6944c22399da6be4aa4c9720341534ba328", "ja": "たしか百合子は、ダンスが\nあんまり得意じゃなかったよね？", "zh": "我记得百合子不太擅长跳舞？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "a647535ef1c1f081b0266856af7c7c413578302594445dc2e086ef447ed12cf3", "ja": "そういえば……レッスンの、時……\n百合子さん……いつも、つまずいてる……ね……。", "zh": "这么说来……练习时……\n百合子……常常会跌倒……呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "426c4fe9e84cc2572f11bd2618b652e545ff09336d5545a4b23398eb0e692179", "ja": "うっ。そ、それは……ダンスというか、\nそもそも運動自体があんまり得意じゃなくて……。", "zh": "呜，那、那个……与其说是不擅长跳舞，\n应该是我本来就不太擅长运动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "3eac6a74f85e031dd1694c6daa7a1998900e292eb78aa38ee43f6f78c1666b8c", "ja": "だったら、なおさら克服しなきゃ！\n公演までまだ時間があるし、特訓しよう！", "zh": "如果是这样，就更该好好克服它！\n距离公演还有一段时间，我们来特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d513ff728446616b0b1602da75e0701dd498e38ba8b0c2724cee3b200aba99e", "ja": "と、特訓……。\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いますか……？", "zh": "特、特训……\n{$P$}先生也这么想吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2892474e5b448ac2a1c7e24834837db7976c6367c5c399d937ff41445f3e7b8c", "ja": "そうだな。今後のためにも、\n苦手なことを克服しておいて損はないと思うけど。", "zh": "是啊，也算是为了以后着想，\n能克服不擅长的事物，绝对是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "d4dd587f3479434417e16164ee167094a13da3962b9521185a01545f62644f30", "ja": "そうですよね、{$P$}！\nそうと決まれば、さっそく始めよう、百合子！", "zh": "就是说啊，{$P$}！\n既然都这么决定了，我们就赶快开始吧，百合子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "ddf0770f918eb9b169cb680557632bd5a4302e54975545288ab041290691656c", "ja": "わ、わかりました……主人公なのに、\n苦手なことから逃げてちゃ、ダメですもんね！", "zh": "我、我知道了……身为主角，\n怎么可以逃避不擅长的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "2ced4fa43dd45425c6383b75190b1e73858d39ad788c070203a2efe6bb3e9639", "ja": "その意気だよ、百合子！\n大丈夫、私達も協力するから。ねっ、杏奈ちゃん！", "zh": "就是这个气势，百合子！\n不用担心，我们也会帮你的。对吧，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "e1246959d98d6d46d55a85112c19eaa2ee48d15a202b62c6a817ec2e25d6b2b5", "ja": "え……杏奈は、別に…………。", "zh": "咦……杏奈……其实…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9f3416edd08dc389af578ab4b0c84a8a0125d4fff9f131681655a937df65752", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん……！", "zh": "小杏……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "a19375ee06020275f96c2d042f2ff57358810f89f4268762c93544f4f6665db1", "ja": "……わかった……。\n杏奈……頑張る……。", "zh": "……知道了……\n杏奈……会加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "db852b8ee957e28d9c7265643beaa4a2c2146395a3bd4309917f27817c5e469c", "ja": "紗代子さん、杏奈ちゃん、ありがとう！", "zh": "纱代子、小杏，谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "010265e3cd2be06eb4d673a7c76939c77c55c905877fef3231f474650f199846", "ja": "私……必ず、この地獄のような特訓に耐えて、\n苦手なダンスを克服してみせますっ！", "zh": "我……一定要撑过这个地狱般的特训，\n克服不擅长的舞蹈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "af367ceb2e9ad61ae68d1522779d0b8ae4c99bcf4486600c5eb10f3a62db7be0", "ja": "え……？　じ、地獄……なの……？", "zh": "咦……？地、地狱……般的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "258746d9aed451e5ba4e7edd3246bdc597c9837b9581ce712e326c6768285fca", "ja": "頑張ろうね、百合子、杏奈ちゃん！\nそれじゃあ早速、レッスンルームに行くよ！", "zh": "一起加油吧，百合子、杏奈！\n那我们赶快去练习室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c601e0a5611c3e8fec5c7be2f777607663d30f9c738c5e4d5b02c772c2be85d3", "ja": "（一体どんな特訓を……。\n念のため、様子を見に行くか）", "zh": "（她们到底是要做什么样的特训……？\n保险起见，我还是去看一下好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "ef949e441df9720a19c822dbef5076279da2e72529f7f6c939f94638ab71274e", "ja": "けど、紗代子さん。\n特訓って、具体的にどんなことをするんですか？", "zh": "可是，纱代子，\n所谓的特训，具体来说要做些什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "f734707a98da7e169d7a07e87c8ac6e59213566a3f0c8e422cbb0b965f65286b", "ja": "ちょっと待ってください。その前に、どうして私まで、\n一緒に特訓することになってるんですか？", "zh": "请等一下，在那之前我有个问题。\n为什么连我也得一起参加特训？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "f6e9d7bbb4eeba888060e5d2f7092a8d08d5a7a0cb29e1475fc417fe0e10ed3e", "ja": "私、次の公演の振り付けを\n練習している最中だったんですけど……。", "zh": "而且我正在练习下次公演的舞步，\n才练到一半……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "6189d6634bc5819ccee1094dd34c1b8d6c6ec39efc45e7099e067eb0ac1f94f7", "ja": "協力……する人……。\n多い方が、いい……と、思う……。", "zh": "帮忙的……人……\n越多……越好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "4dbf1302066e243910c364d081a7b4fe63f3d5a105502fffbf7faf00a1c7593b", "ja": "うん！　その方が、いろんな意見が出て、\nきっと特訓も捗ると思うんだ！", "zh": "嗯！这样才会有更多元的意见，\n肯定也能让特训进行得更顺利！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "f70a05f878ca59ae45cde0e5502f6898acec46beda80fbf4d7b6e87b17bfa843", "ja": "志保、練習の邪魔しちゃってごめんね。\n少しの間、付き合ってもらえないかな……？", "zh": "志保，抱歉打扰你练习。\n可以麻烦你陪我们练一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_1027", "source_sha256": "647358d35ebb468e0fbf96c296f6d39af8d76777b976e4d060f5a83d03685c8b", "ja": "俺からも頼む", "zh": "我也拜托你", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2000_p", "source_sha256": "25b9f759ec8a4e1e9bd08a6960dcb9478a4bc5726f8ed86c6868f05105ece40b", "ja": "志保、俺からも頼む。\n百合子達に力を貸してやってくれないか？", "zh": "志保，我也拜托你。\n可以请你帮忙百合子她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2001_033sih", "source_sha256": "91ade79f2fca4395140131aa0edd6083a6558a8c47e00ee258b3ea3ad73c68c7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。いたんですか。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……你也在啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2002_033sih", "source_sha256": "bbe651c5c8ac06e311affb16110b31f480cd51b7b63330ca179a6ef9e036dec3", "ja": "はぁ。{$P$}さんが言うなら、\n仕方ないですね。わかりました。", "zh": "唉，既然{$P$}先生都这么说了，\n真拿你们没办法。我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2003_033sih", "source_sha256": "825d433ff3db32f78382266248b00ea391192b0de0c8926fe1bb23bc68b83586", "ja": "でも、私にとって意味がない特訓だったら、すぐに\n抜けさせてもらいます。そのつもりでお願いします。", "zh": "不过，如果那个特训对我来说没有任何帮助，\n请容我马上退出。这样可以接受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2004_026yur", "source_sha256": "df9eefd115dede150203f05529c9195769753f7eaf36f99d157354242f48b4d2", "ja": "あ、ありがとう、志保……！", "zh": "谢、谢谢你，志保……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2005_027say", "source_sha256": "1800fd6a6e0b74d643a2c0fdb196e66489df0a35a131a870b42ba94e6f0e95d0", "ja": "それじゃあ、特訓の内容についてだけど……\n私はやっぱり、ダンスには体力が必須だと思う。", "zh": "接着是关于特训的内容……\n我还是觉得体力是舞蹈不可或缺的关键。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2006_033sih", "source_sha256": "6923a6b6e69839d7f1449e67a21f3e0ebed16dfd673eb8dc3ee06789402e13d8", "ja": "……？　そうでしょうか。私は、そうは思いません。\n振り付けを完璧に覚える方が、先じゃないですか？", "zh": "……？是吗？我不这么认为。\n完美地记住舞步，才是最重要的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2007_033sih", "source_sha256": "33bd775cc7c7921e4c8a1a057fa5642d33b3e519c469e23e581c36f608cd4d45", "ja": "振り付けを完璧にすれば、ミスがなくなります。\n苦手意識をなくすには、一番効率的だと思いますけど。", "zh": "只要把舞步练到完美，就不会出错。\n要想消除对舞蹈的恐惧感，这应该是最有效率的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2008_026yur", "source_sha256": "7e52e60840be65f52360c76f364f343f908ac7675eda8308cee436c72117c8e5", "ja": "体力づくり？　それとも、振り付けを覚える？\nどっちも、レッスンの基本中の基本だけど……。", "zh": "加强体力？还是记住舞步？\n虽然就舞蹈训练而言，两者都是基础中的基础……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2009_026yur", "source_sha256": "3233e9653b1c08f4909988b4d6ca833882e8462deebd94b5dd2fd7eb004b6b52", "ja": "同時に、ふたつのことをやるだなんて……\nわ、私、ついていけるかな～……？", "zh": "两个同时进行的话……\n我、我做得来吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2010_033sih", "source_sha256": "55f4eb98f156a13a3650fad371161f515cac1d159c3f1acf6e50fa651f8cad44", "ja": "杏奈、あなたはどう？　何か思いついた？", "zh": "杏奈，你觉得呢？你有什么想法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2011_024ann", "source_sha256": "8c2e3048fb17994bab922b9d0a5d723d29cc89bb80198b8d34e4e97c9648fcd4", "ja": "えっと……ダンスゲームで、感覚……掴む、とか……？\n最近のは……よく、できてる……から……。", "zh": "那个……透过舞蹈游戏……抓住感觉之类的……？\n最近的电玩……都做得很好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2012_026yur", "source_sha256": "58c2324157e965d11fdd0f7815717511e22fb72c379d729a227ab07b5a63a50d", "ja": "ダンスゲームかぁ……。\nあんまりやったことないけど、面白そうかも？", "zh": "舞蹈游戏啊……\n我没什么玩过，但听起来好像很有趣？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2013_026yur", "source_sha256": "3ca250154c31c803dc0f04d2e823f14e979f789253e652a53d3a71bb9b1fa5fc", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん！\n{$P$}さんは、何か意見ありますか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生！\n{$P$}先生有什么提议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_2014", "source_sha256": "a81076b7d9da3e50d67f17757ab706f593feeefb942c960253735efe8eae876d", "ja": "必要ない", "zh": "不需要", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3000_p", "source_sha256": "b42e0be4ee23299c2c46652fb1b661fb4864b4db52bc07548f0672626040dca0", "ja": "意見なら、たくさん出てるじゃないか。\n俺が付け足す必要はないかな。", "zh": "已经有很多提案了，\n应该不需要我的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3001_p", "source_sha256": "4ebd5c0df77d21a13c6498eeea64abb8abed4392ea62fa0206630ac1e6ecfda9", "ja": "あとは百合子がみんなと話して、\n思うようにやってみるのが一番いいと思う。", "zh": "剩下的就由百合子和大家讨论，\n照自己想的去做就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3002_026yur", "source_sha256": "bbd825bfa0cad108e81138a14ce1c096f44f6ae9d696c5f699e24801ba45a508", "ja": "思うように、ですか……うぅ……。", "zh": "照自己想的去做吗……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3003_033sih", "source_sha256": "8b20754b0500dce9646522ae98a3cacca355a3aa9ed49ad26995210bdc494971", "ja": "……それって要するに、\n何も考えてないってことですよね。", "zh": "你那句话的意思……\n就是你什么都没在想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3004_p", "source_sha256": "7ba7bd457f292e09b4e4ccc87c14f38bf96231cf991ab36bb67ba4758a25bd98", "ja": "い、いやいや。みんなが真剣に考えてるなら、\n俺が口を出さない方がいいかなと……。", "zh": "不、不是。我是想说大家都那么认真在想了，\n我还是不要多话会比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3005_027say", "source_sha256": "424e933f7ad7310a11a043c626b99f7b88689116b1dfff79937b2b9a612a815f", "ja": "わかりました！　それじゃあ……\n今出てきた案、全部試してみよう！！", "zh": "我知道了！既然如此……\n就把刚刚的提案，全都试一次吧！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3006_026yur", "source_sha256": "d54cba35f831ae57fcb72901d4a1ba817f5c5a8597cce0422d8c39a2b69ea7ce", "ja": "えっ。ぜ、全部！？", "zh": "咦？全、全部！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3007_027say", "source_sha256": "95837835642ffb311d4bf3fb698b3324e48d3715b9a11ae9ddb72927d3139b8f", "ja": "特訓だし、主人公にはこれくらい必要だと思う！\nそれじゃみんな、行くよーっ！", "zh": "毕竟是特训，对主角来说这点程度的训练是必须的！\n各位，我们开始吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3008_026yur", "source_sha256": "083acef94c344c67737bebe1479a5bae5f047ff0b95356589d987f21e6109313", "ja": "主人公……そ、そうでした！\nわかりました！　私、頑張ります！", "zh": "主角……原、原来是这样！\n我明白了！我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3009_null", "source_sha256": "fd57bb583b3cab56f5c968deb3bbbcf764319c8713fb7fda35b16dd435a11cbc", "ja": "そうして、百合子達の特訓が始まった……", "zh": "就这样，百合子她们的特训开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3010_026yur", "source_sha256": "f3fe2110e844ad7d473834705efaf093c879edf9903da5441d4fc7b1b337ca94", "ja": "はぁっ、はぁっ、はぁっ……！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3011_027say", "source_sha256": "63bbe676da7523d0312018a9b4e6facda8b0adfa68e5ed0c5833c34e3a997f43", "ja": "百合子！　走り込み、あと10往復だよ！", "zh": "百合子！还要再来回跑10次喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3012_026yur", "source_sha256": "012b471e127d58e4d8b4e4b35476db8fac7e125d26e45157598bc5c6afb52e17", "ja": "は、はぃぃ……！　って、まだそんなに！？", "zh": "好、好的……！咦？还要跑那么多次！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3013_se", "source_sha256": "fb54b0676838c8ac89f8933fede9a2c9d56db17746f99b24e9e05f596cd3017b", "ja": "ピコン、ピコン……ブブー！", "zh": "叮咚、叮咚……噗噗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3014_026yur", "source_sha256": "b2796ee5e9abc7bbc85c56fa9f554f8701702166f719e4a1d37e678dd402a15f", "ja": "ああっ、ま、またミスしちゃった……！\nね、ねぇ、杏奈ちゃん。1回くらいは許し……。", "zh": "啊啊，我、我又失误了……！\n那、那个，小杏，只错1次没关系吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3015_024ann", "source_sha256": "81db4861d5b0f8d94a79024e7c5b3c57db4a02587711e5e40dbde3400231c723", "ja": "ダメ……。特訓……だから……\nフルコン……しないと……。", "zh": "不行……因为是……特训……\n必须要……Full Combo……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3016_026yur", "source_sha256": "8461ccaa6f4651e357059f7881731e6d3034ea1c7c012da4f1dc5023cfb0c87c", "ja": "フルコンっていっても、\nこの曲、難しすぎるよ～！？", "zh": "就算你说要Full Combo，\n这首歌也太难了吧～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3017_033sih", "source_sha256": "0ac4ffab612556a30456d085bb3b07adfd2fb259395455aac8dd9b0372f800ed", "ja": "百合子さん。\n今度は、サビの部分のステップが間違ってます。", "zh": "百合子。\n这次换副歌的部分跳错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3018_026yur", "source_sha256": "f9de131f0034d5c3d0ebbc7fa670490db38577babbfa4b18fb7812c2245fecc2", "ja": "えええっ！？　ひ、ひとつ覚えたと思ったら、\nまた違うところを間違えるだなんて……。", "zh": "咦咦咦！？才、才记住一个，\n竟然又跳错另一个地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3019_033sih", "source_sha256": "630c1be1594b482b6272521938eab36764957e57b7437f9a9017911c18012f20", "ja": "でも、そうやってひとつずつミスを潰していけば、\n最終的にミスはなくなります。", "zh": "不过，只要像这样一个个把错误改正，\n最后就不会再出错了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3020_026yur", "source_sha256": "52efe07264fb9d764e560806361271159c07166f44f84aecc3b15c877da3060d", "ja": "わかってるけど……。\nうう、気が遠くなるよ～……。", "zh": "我当然知道……\n呜呜，快要昏倒了啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3021_027say", "source_sha256": "3a959ab27bb9d2b7157e27f4fae5270cba7cde6890ab76c1d06989670bfd761c", "ja": "うーん。\n少しずつ、よくなってきてるとは思うんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯……\n我是觉得多少有些进步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3022_033sih", "source_sha256": "8a7ce2a7224903851afb1e34971201d3af183c4fd4db69db595bfbf765fc1766", "ja": "まだ、完璧とは言えませんね。\nあと一歩、足りない気がします。", "zh": "但还说不上完美。\n总觉得还差一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3023_024ann", "source_sha256": "f1b05404fd82ea32b22ef2fb81dfe314840fbda1a494572568d9cc425bf4ec20", "ja": "……？　百合子さん……？\nえっと、大丈夫……？", "zh": "……？百合子……？\n那个，你还好吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3024_026yur", "source_sha256": "108cab63f0b10a014075a6367a5fe62aa9b6512094aa7840a6ee2c7191ff049b", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……はぁ……。うう……。\nしゅ、主人公に……主人公に、ならなきゃ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……呼……唔唔……\n我、我得当好主角……得当好主角才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3025_p", "source_sha256": "2e8f12fc61c65ad37fb3f1fb86e6242676bbe7b1f3928d845a0d7b46c0c71f89", "ja": "百合子、いいから少し落ち着こう。\n……大丈夫か？", "zh": "百合子，没事了，你冷静点。\n……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3026_026yur", "source_sha256": "a4ab83bdade314f44d1bd44018f0eec857eb3acb495be6ea1f4d5244a364473e", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……。\n{$P$}さん……は、はい……。", "zh": "呼……呼……\n{$P$}先生……还、还好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3027_p", "source_sha256": "d8db05aa494d94d9549ce7193295ebd6f7f42db0479b4bfd15513a598ca693b1", "ja": "ちょっと、頑張りすぎちゃったみたいだな。\nみんな、休憩にしようか。", "zh": "看来有点努力过头了。\n大家休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3028_026yur", "source_sha256": "3d3c06523526434d4f5cb9602d49190f230c850cd5239251a9e50dbb9ed37b8e", "ja": "ご、ごめんね、みんな……\n私のせいで、特訓を止めちゃって……。", "zh": "各、各位，对不起……\n都是因为我的关系，才得暂停特训……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3029_027say", "source_sha256": "f768ff3e752d555f565105d2d57ecb3ca5ea97844c393c05d2769853ead6e4c5", "ja": "ううん。それより私達こそ、\n百合子のペースをちゃんと見てなくて、ごめんね……。", "zh": "没有这回事。是我们不好，\n没有顾虑到百合子跟不跟得上，抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3030_033sih", "source_sha256": "4ee68b0497d755333a845be588b4f1f06eba2a6898ed99880acdfec8b372df7f", "ja": "レッスン中の休憩は大事なのに、\nそれを忘れてしまうなんて……すみませんでした。", "zh": "在练习中的休息也很重要，\n我们却忘了这点……真的很抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3031_026yur", "source_sha256": "64f660ca81cafc0412bec5b292690683d82feae354fa7897a19fef8b49ef65ca", "ja": "謝らないで、志保、紗代子さんも…。\nみんな私に協力してくれてるんですから。", "zh": "你们不需要道歉，志保、纱代子……\n大家都只是在帮我而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3032_026yur", "source_sha256": "d3bcd07b2b17b2296e549dfa36a20b68a448a383abd68bd2c864e478c3442200", "ja": "はぁ……。", "zh": "唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3033_024ann", "source_sha256": "a91cd4706524ca122cd18c26ebe022659a4a5cb6f562d476fb56cfcfd5b5397f", "ja": "百合子さん……？", "zh": "百合子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3034_026yur", "source_sha256": "70dc7223a8ca757ce8ca330706566bf116e1e93f496eb757000a3973c26124f7", "ja": "こんなに協力してもらってるのに、ちっとも\n成果が出ないなんて。なんか落ち込んじゃうなぁ……。", "zh": "大家都这么帮我了，\n我却没有拿出什么成果，总觉得很难过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3035_026yur", "source_sha256": "5d09fa4f8c360f95d90e059fd1aa98060c3493a02d775e0300ac3c54ba1a8c6a", "ja": "やっぱり、私みたいな平凡な子に、主人公は\n難しかったのかな？なんて。あはは……。", "zh": "像我这样平凡的女生，\n想当主角还是太难了吧？哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3036_p", "source_sha256": "207e6d24815f6fc58560cd5573236aeef13ab607e8133c35ae569b17bc49921e", "ja": "百合子、それは……。", "zh": "百合子，你这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3037_033sih", "source_sha256": "13f7bfa1b306ff0333197307a27392cf663e7f7956cbc8d173b75f8e919920da", "ja": "それは、違うんじゃないですか？", "zh": "你这么说就错了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3038_026yur", "source_sha256": "eb56b1675a9187731fb2701ae476f33e7882c8a7ec5174f583d04a1253b4c7fe", "ja": "えっ？　し、志保……？", "zh": "咦？志、志保……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3039_033sih", "source_sha256": "96781f01e50671ab43e0acce140c2897e1f243910e446553879ef861651eae45", "ja": "すごい主人公なんて、結果論だと思います。だって\n主人公って、最初はだいたい弱いじゃないですか。", "zh": "那些很厉害的主角，都只是从结果来看的。\n所谓的主角，在一开始时大多不都很弱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3040_033sih", "source_sha256": "b2c9baad0f8dbc641bc7a1dcf1a91fac77d84e7ea158acf9cd16e3c3773aae7b", "ja": "百合子さんなら、よく知ってるんじゃないですか。\nそういう、お決まりのパターンみたいなのとか。", "zh": "百合子应该很清楚吧。\n这种事情，就像是固定套路一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3041_026yur", "source_sha256": "7a90a446614e75e94ddfd8793c791bf94654dcb8e3a4c966fff9cab2ca63e7f3", "ja": "あっ……う、うん。\nそうだけど……。", "zh": "啊……嗯，是啊。\n是这样没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3042_033sih", "source_sha256": "bee657cdecf56e9a759ab6590a6c593c549a741a22eeb8530c38d8523f638551", "ja": "だったら、弱音をはくのは早いと思います。\n主人公を目指してるんじゃなかったんですか？", "zh": "如果你也认同，那你现在退缩还太早了。\n你不是以成为主角为目标吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3043_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3044_024ann", "source_sha256": "3b99049fbae64cc3c56eb205628a297119cdd345c38ebbed1a112bbf44e5f439", "ja": "……百合子さん……ゲームも、同じ……だよ……。\n最初は、みんな……レベル1……。", "zh": "……百合子……电玩也一样……喔……\n大家一开始……都是Lv1……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3045_024ann", "source_sha256": "7bbc1b4de83f54c2154b055a95dbb9c3f8bf90f5bd5e764f143769dff14d30e3", "ja": "百合子さんは、まだ……ゲームオーバー、に……\nなってないと……杏奈、思い……ます……。", "zh": "杏奈觉得百合子的游戏……\n还没Game Over……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3046_026yur", "source_sha256": "8e648b340a6c449ee5a1286f3365ceb5cb05aa34936ea1cea50e65f5b1fe6957", "ja": "志保……杏奈ちゃん……。", "zh": "志保……小杏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3047_p", "source_sha256": "a2b63e0c215d01a16a8a8515aea95ddcd396b3902736195314b3d62a80723ca4", "ja": "そうだな。\n百合子、この前、みんなと小説の話をしてただろ？", "zh": "没错。\n百合子，你之前不是有和大家聊小说的话题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3048_p", "source_sha256": "234da04b89beb595991af4ad3a3f8c394d3ab730e6cafc654faefad93b763231", "ja": "百合子は、今回の公演の主人公なんだ。\n与えられた使命を、乗り越えなくていいのか？", "zh": "百合子就是这次公演的主角。\n不完成被赋予的使命，你真的觉得没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3050_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb93fefdacfec349f75eaca665fecc4c1e1d01fe34d4c08becbf8005b7707039", "ja": "私……まだ、自信なんかありません。\nでも、ひとつだけ、思い出したことがあります。", "zh": "我……还是对自己没自信。\n不过，我想起了一件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3051_026yur", "source_sha256": "6922cf18af7e24d07fc2ea22148eeb272d3ac42c0263177482693d1f65dceb96", "ja": "どんな困難が襲ってきても……私の好きな主人公は、\n最後まで絶対に諦めなかったっていうことです！", "zh": "不管遇到什么样的困难……\n我喜欢的主角不到最后关头，绝不轻言放弃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3052_p", "source_sha256": "30f8cbe54cfda78d006006d9e28a078248cfba567d0ac08cafa3753929a367c7", "ja": "そうだな。\nだから主人公は、主人公なんだ。", "zh": "说得没错。\n所以主角才会是主角。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3053_026yur", "source_sha256": "8fc4e12c28f083995ba3fffe549df161e025804ebe95b7494187d4049e18ca73", "ja": "はい。主人公が諦めたら、物語が終わってしまいます。\nだから私は、絶対に諦めちゃダメなんです。", "zh": "是的，主角要是放弃，故事就结束了。\n所以我绝对不能放弃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3054_027say", "source_sha256": "c0f428bd8372f75129def84d4916807fe1239c2bf21ff0d0216b998ad4f65bdd", "ja": "百合子……！", "zh": "百合子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3055_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3db6b304fe4512f363553770d61ab99d0eba9d5c2f64274884e66eb900f4e60", "ja": "百合子、さん……。うん……！", "zh": "百合子……嗯……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3056_026yur", "source_sha256": "455bd5b782b91e0a9bfdda9f58f4a796425b3bfb0511f684bc8d961e34877424", "ja": "みんな！　私、もう弱音なんかはきません！\nだから次の公演、絶対に成功させようね！", "zh": "各位！我已经不会再退缩了！\n所以下次的公演，我们一定要让它成功喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3057_026yur", "source_sha256": "c20e99e31d192e13640f58c50426fc7acafef559ff71236fc71bc10608c2d65d", "ja": "あのっ……私のこと、助けてくれますか？\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "那个……你愿意助我一臂之力吗？\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3058_p", "source_sha256": "b7e8d534ba696ce3329218819fba6acca4d9fca4acacf648e3a4f0eda2f7dfec", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n百合子が主人公のステージを、みんなに見せよう！", "zh": "是啊，当然。\n让大家见识一下由百合子当主角的舞台吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3059_026yur", "source_sha256": "9c62e829c21e1f1285bb00562ad24a573a73c8a77ce3a0be293997d7ffaa1fcb", "ja": "はい！　みなさんの元に、届けてみせます！\n私が描くステージ……私の、物語を……！", "zh": "是！我会试着传达给大家的！\n把我心中描绘的舞台……还有我的故事……传递出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3060_026yur", "source_sha256": "b023e8d841b833edd6a0e0b62cb6bb3d0647935ab701536e79dde860cd026542", "ja": "あっ。で、でも！　私ひとりの力じゃ、\n公演を成功させるなんて絶対に無理だから……。", "zh": "啊，不、不过！只靠我一个人的力量，\n绝对无法让公演成功，所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3061_026yur", "source_sha256": "075464d0278f7aa114d8700735f0b605e94780ecd8d33407706abf94dce15b86", "ja": "紗代子さん、杏奈ちゃん、志保……\nどうか私に、力を貸してください！", "zh": "纱代子、小杏、志保……\n请你们协助我一起完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3062_027say", "source_sha256": "c040c21eaa4605bfa32b53ff4663253144c4bb8610da6f3e9ed6885bad478858", "ja": "もちろんだよ！　私は百合子が諦めないなら、\nどこまでだって協力するよっ！", "zh": "当然没问题！只要百合子不放弃，\n我就会一直帮忙下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3063_033sih", "source_sha256": "17561298a1e51568f4ee938719919c21bf848f89c8d33d654542a133eb220cff", "ja": "そうですね。乗りかかった船って言いますし……\nここでやめても、なんだか居心地が悪いですから。", "zh": "是啊，俗话说一不做，二不休……\n在这时候放弃，感觉也很不愉快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3064_024ann", "source_sha256": "1aa1f0dbd321c3e992013b9e70effd5797e8d212614dcce6ccd4b4d03833bb77", "ja": "杏奈も……頑張る……。\n百合子さん……一緒に、頑張ろう……！", "zh": "杏奈……也会加油……\n百合子……一起加油吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3065_026yur", "source_sha256": "b86f5c49ef580788f6037771142ddc529a70183ffb872186fdae69def1845541", "ja": "みんな……ありがとう！", "zh": "大家……谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3066_p", "source_sha256": "b8e9135360e0fd0ac1f7056a5b87ce62dfd3406bb48ef0aa8ca1c3d38d260266", "ja": "（物語の主人公に仲間がいるように、\n百合子にも、こんなに頼もしい仲間がいる）", "zh": "（就像故事的主角有伙伴陪伴一样，\n百合子的身边，也有可靠的伙伴。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_006_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_006_3067_p", "source_sha256": "76599157520bc063457d8f0be5f78e7853dd1011b6a48e5d822f6bd3bbf81db3", "ja": "（公演の先に、百合子が何を見つけるのか……\n次の章を楽しみに、ページをめくろう！）", "zh": "（在公演之后，百合子会有什么样的发现呢……？\n怀抱期待续章进展的心，翻开下一页吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
